   "source": [
    "### 7. Fisher Information of a Univariate Gaussian\n",
    "For parameter vector $\\theta = [\\mu, \\sigma^2]^T$:\n",
    "$$F(\\mu, \\sigma^2) = \\begin{bmatrix} \\frac{1}{\\sigma^2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{2\\sigma^4} \\end{bmatrix}$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
